    "秩与行列式的关系"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "当$x=1$时，按第一行展开计算行列式",
    "写出特征多项式$\\det(A-\\lambda I)=0$",
    "通过试根法或直接计算求出三个特征值",
    "对每个特征值解齐次线性方程组$(A-\\lambda I)v=0$求特征向量",
    "利用$\\det(A)=0$确定使秩为2的参数条件"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "parameter_dependent_matrix_analysis",
    "template": "给定含参数 $x$ 的 $3\\times 3$ 矩阵 $A$，分别计算其行列式、特征值、特征向量，及参数约束条件",
    "variable_count": 1
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1) 当 $x=1$ 时的行列式",
      "steps": [
        "当 $x=1$ 时，$A = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 \\end{bmatrix}$",
        "按第一行展开：",
        "$$\\det(A) = 0 \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} - (-2) \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} -3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} + 2 \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} -3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix}$$",
        "计算各2阶子式：",
        "$$\\begin{vmatrix} -3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} = -9 - (-3) = -6$$",
        "$$\\begin{vmatrix} -3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = -3 - (-1) = -2$$",
        "代入：$\\det(A) = 0 + 2(-6) + 2(-2) = -12 - 4 = -16$",
        "**答：$\\det(A) = -16$**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2) 特征值与特征向量",
      "steps": [
        "特征多项式为 $\\det(A - \\lambda I) = 0$：",
        "$$\\det \\begin{bmatrix} -\\lambda & -2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 1-\\lambda & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3-\\lambda \\end{bmatrix}$$",
        "按第一行展开并化简得：$-\\lambda^3 + 4\\lambda^2 + 4\\lambda - 16 = 0$",
        "即：$\\lambda^3 - 4\\lambda^2 - 4\\lambda + 16 = 0$",
        "试 $\\lambda = 2$：$8 - 16 - 8 + 16 = 0$ ✓",
        "因式分解：$(\\lambda - 2)(\\lambda^2 - 2\\lambda - 8) = 0$",
        "解 $\\lambda^2 - 2\\lambda - 8 = 0$：$\\lambda = \\frac{2 \\pm \\sqrt{4+32}}{2} = \\frac{2 \\pm 6}{2}$",
        "得 $\\lambda = 4$ 或 $\\lambda = -2$",
        "**特征值为：$\\lambda_1 = 2, \\lambda_2 = 4, \\lambda_3 = -2$**",
        "**对于 $\\lambda_1 = 2$：** 解 $(A-2I)v = 0$",
        "$$\\begin{bmatrix} -2 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} v_1 \\\\ v_2 \\\\ v_3 \\end{bmatrix} = 0$$",
        "从第一行：$-v_1 - v_2 + v_3 = 0 \\Rightarrow v_3 = v_1 + v_2$",
        "从第三行：$-v_1 + v_2 + v_3 = 0$，代入得 $2v_2 = 0 \\Rightarrow v_2 = 0$",
        "故 $v_3 = v_1$，取 $v_1 = 1$，特征向量为 $\\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix}$",
        "**对于 $\\lambda_2 = 4$：** 解 $(A-4I)v = 0$",
        "$$\\begin{bmatrix} -4 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} v_1 \\\\ v_2 \\\\ v_3 \\end{bmatrix} = 0$$",
        "从第三行：$-v_1 + v_2 - v_3 = 0$",
        "从第二行：$-v_1 - v_2 + v_3 = 0$",
        "两式相加：$-2v_1 = 0 \\Rightarrow v_1 = 0$，则 $v_2 = v_3$",
        "特征向量为 $\\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix}$",
        "**对于 $\\lambda_3 = -2$：** 解 $(A+2I)v = 0$",
        "$$\\begin{bmatrix} 2 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 5 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} v_1 \\\\ v_2 \\\\ v_3 \\end{bmatrix} = 0$$",
        "从第一行：$v_1 - v_2 + v_3 = 0$",
        "从第二行：$-v_1 + v_2 + v_3 = 0$",
        "相加得：$2v_3 = 0 \\Rightarrow v_3 = 0$，则 $v_1 = v_2$",
        "特征向量为 $\\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(3) 秩为2时的参数值",
      "steps": [
        "矩阵秩为2当且仅当 $\\det(A) = 0$ 且矩阵不为零矩阵",
        "计算 $\\det(A)$（按第一行展开）：",
        "$$\\det(A) = 2 \\begin{vmatrix} -3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} + 2 \\begin{vmatrix} -3 & x \\\\ -1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix}$$",
        "$$= 2(-9+3) + 2(-3+x) = 2(-6) + 2(x-3) = -12 + 2x - 6 = 2x - 18$$",
        "令 $\\det(A) = 0$：$2x - 18 = 0 \\Rightarrow x = 9$",
        "验证：当 $x=9$ 时，矩阵显然不为零矩阵（如第$(1,2)$元素为$-2$），秩确实为2",
        "**答：$x = 9$**"
      ]
    }
  ],
